{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063824/block/singleImage/3267419/df/01M7EJP3CD2FMGQY9F44P1SFT5.jpg?updatedAt=1794712414\"/><figcaption>黃大仙下邨有單位起火。(網民Alex Ox ChamkinGs@FB群組「黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)」)</figcaption></figure><p>黃大仙發生火警。早上8時47分警方接獲多宗報案指，黃大仙下邨龍光樓一個單位發生火警，並指一度傳出爆炸聲。消防接報出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約29分鐘後將火救熄，其後在起火單位發現一具屍體。 據報，經人員初步調查，懷疑因單位內雜物起火肇禍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:35:31.976008+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T03:13:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T05:09:24.506863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:28:56.289438+00:00","content_hash":"dbe1406b8fb82938989bfda6737107190af667c8aff0e5681523c48b4c6b75dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}